    "Id": "chassisdef_pulsar_PSR-A",
    "Name": "Pulsar",
    "Details": "Developed following the successful deployment of the Parash 3, the Pulsar is a 50-ton OmniMech based on the venerable Nova and built around the Society's Interface Cockpit. The Prime configuration is a straightforward energy brawler, delivering repeated heavy alpha strikes while closing with the enemy and using its Nova CEWS and TAG to support allied forces. Its relentless volleys inspired the Pulsar name, reflecting the regular bursts of energy that characterize its combat style.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Narrow/Low Profile</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.05</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
